D press fit, 82.8 long (machined from a sleeve blank)',(#125042));
#125049=PRODUCT('TCE-409','HeadGasket',
'Head gasket MLS 0.8 compressed, 63 fire rings (custom laser-cut; Come
tic custom service class)',(#125042));
#125050=PRODUCT('TCE-405','CylinderHead',
'Cylinder head, air-cooled DOHC 4-valve: pent roof 2 x 14 deg (chamber
 12.01 cc), 8 x 25 bucket bores, guide bores 9.5, 2 x M10x1 plug wells
, ports 24 / 22 with flanged bosses, cam line bores 22 (with caps), 8 
stud C''bores, 7 fins front and back; one-off from billet, valve seats
 cut for sintered inserts',(#125042));
#125051=PRODUCT('TCE-407','CamCover',
